# 【算法思路】通过 ABC 抽象基类约束统一缓存接口，分别实现本地内存缓存与带前缀隔离的模拟 Redis 缓存。
from abc import ABC, abstractmethod
import time

# 声明 get/set/delete/exists 抽象方法契约
class CacheBackend(ABC):
    """统一缓存后端抽象接口"""
    @abstractmethod
    def get(self, key: str): pass

    @abstractmethod
    def set(self, key: str, value, ttl: int = 0) -> None: pass

    @abstractmethod
    def delete(self, key: str) -> bool: pass

    @abstractmethod
    def exists(self, key: str) -> bool: pass

# 内存字典与 TTL 过期时间戳维护
class MemoryCache(CacheBackend):
    """基于本地字典的内存缓存实现"""
    def __init__(self):
        self._store = {}
        self._expiry = {}

    def _is_expired(self, key: str) -> bool:
        if key in self._expiry and time.time() > self._expiry[key]:
            del self._store[key]
            del self._expiry[key]
            return True
        return False

    def get(self, key: str):
        if self._is_expired(key):
            return None
        return self._store.get(key)

    def set(self, key: str, value, ttl: int = 0) -> None:
        self._store[key] = value
        if ttl > 0:
            self._expiry[key] = time.time() + ttl
        elif key in self._expiry:
            del self._expiry[key]

    def delete(self, key: str) -> bool:
        existed = key in self._store
        self._store.pop(key, None)
        self._expiry.pop(key, None)
        return existed

    def exists(self, key: str) -> bool:
        if self._is_expired(key):
            return False
        return key in self._store

# 自动添加 redis: 前缀的后端实现
class RedisCacheMock(CacheBackend):
    """带 redis: 前缀隔离的模拟 Redis 缓存"""
    def __init__(self):
        self._store = {}
        self._expiry = {}

    def _prefix(self, key: str) -> str:
        return f'redis:{key}'

    def _is_expired(self, key: str) -> bool:
        pk = self._prefix(key)
        if pk in self._expiry and time.time() > self._expiry[pk]:
            del self._store[pk]
            del self._expiry[pk]
            return True
        return False

    def get(self, key: str):
        pk = self._prefix(key)
        if self._is_expired(key):
            return None
        return self._store.get(pk)

    def set(self, key: str, value, ttl: int = 0) -> None:
        pk = self._prefix(key)
        self._store[pk] = value
        if ttl > 0:
            self._expiry[pk] = time.time() + ttl
        elif pk in self._expiry:
            del self._expiry[pk]

    def delete(self, key: str) -> bool:
        pk = self._prefix(key)
        existed = pk in self._store
        self._store.pop(pk, None)
        self._expiry.pop(pk, None)
        return existed

    def exists(self, key: str) -> bool:
        if self._is_expired(key):
            return False
        return self._prefix(key) in self._store

# 评测入口（请勿修改）
def eval_cache(cache_type: str, actions: list[dict]):
    cache = MemoryCache() if cache_type == "memory" else RedisCacheMock()
    last = None
    for act in actions:
        op = act["op"]
        if op == "set":
            cache.set(act["key"], act["value"], act.get("ttl", 0))
        elif op == "get":
            last = cache.get(act["key"])
        elif op == "delete":
            last = cache.delete(act["key"])
        elif op == "exists":
            last = cache.exists(act["key"])
    return last

